{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。\n今ハリーポッター見てる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は生写真の撮影と\n取材がありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズムって\nどこで踊ってるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手端のいちばんうしろだよ！\n飛び出てるからすぐわかるよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の握手会で思ったんだけど、\nそろそろまりか単推しにしようと\n思うけど、どうかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今からでもまりっ会への\n入会は可能ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今更だけどこれからまりかのこと\n推してもいいかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手をして、推したい！って\n思ってくれるのはとても嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会入会決定"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリジナル缶バッチのメッセージの\n中で、万理華ちゃんはどの文字なの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"E！\nシンプルな怪獣。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手のとき、\nファンの皆のどこをよく見る？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔を見ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから毎回コメントしても\nいいかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございますっ\n今日もコメント読んで\n元気もらっています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無言握手ってOKですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツッコんじゃうかも笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわご♡2013.3.22"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと毒舌よこの子は...\nでもおもしろいし、よくしゃべるし！\nそんな川後すきだけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握での服とかみんなより\n工夫してて尊敬します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pv怖かったけど、\n見てる内にはまって何回も見てる！\nほんと美人だなあ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうね！だいすきよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/22/6165463/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またＷひなと遊びたい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}